MultiLingualTexts:
  - id: MLC_1
    en-US: signals from external model
  - id: MLC_2
    en-US: model parameter
  - id: MLC_3
    en-US: application operation
  - id: MLC_4
    en-US: current signals from tank
  - id: MLC_5
    en-US: current process information
  - id: MLC_6
    en-US: signals from hmi
  - id: MLC_7
    en-US: signals from app
  - id: MLC_8
    en-US: trigger for start command
  - id: MLC_9
    en-US: trigger for stop command
  - id: MLC_10
    en-US: trigger for reset command
  - id: MLC_11
    en-US: helper variable to initialize some parameters
  - id: MLC_12
    en-US: trigger to shift next bottle
  - id: MLC_13
    en-US: trigger to set error
  - id: MLC_14
    en-US: memory for reactivating state after STOP
  - id: MLC_15
    en-US: trigger to generate program alarm
  - id: MLC_16
    en-US: helper for hmi (true, if state 1-4)
  - id: MLC_17
    en-US: trigger when tank is empty
  - id: MLC_18
    en-US: tank empty memory
  - id: MLC_19
    en-US: overflow of counter "numberProduced"
  - id: MLC_20
    en-US: trigger to start after overflow
  - id: MLC_21
    en-US: values for Gen_UsrMsg block
  - id: MLC_22
    en-US: Handling signals from hmi or app
  - id: MLC_23
    en-US: '--[P]-- (positive signal edge) -> stat-Variable becomes true for one cycle'
  - id: MLC_24
    en-US: Reset signals from hmi or app
  - id: MLC_25
    en-US: Helper for hmi display
  - id: MLC_26
    en-US: 'SHIFTING: shifting bottle - timer'
  - id: MLC_27
    en-US: Tank empty during filling process
  - id: MLC_28
    en-US: Init
  - id: MLC_29
    en-US: Filling tank
  - id: MLC_30
    en-US: Heating tank
  - id: MLC_31
    en-US: Filling bottle
  - id: MLC_32
    en-US: Shifting bottle
  - id: MLC_33
    en-US: Catch overflow
  - id: MLC_34
    en-US: |-
      If max of UDINT is reached
      > Stop (automatically)
      > Reset (automatically)
      > Start (automatically)
  - id: MLC_35
    en-US: Stop
  - id: MLC_36
    en-US: Reset
  - id: MLC_37
    en-US: Error
  - id: MLC_38
    en-US: Set machine state
  - id: MLC_39
    en-US: |-
      1 = filling tank
      2 = heating tank
      3 = filling bottle
      4 = shifting bottle
      5 = stop
      6 = reset
      7 = error
  - id: MLC_40
    en-US: Set machine state OEE
  - id: MLC_41
    en-US: |-
      1 = production
      2 = planned down
      3 = unplanned down
  - id: MLC_42
    en-US: Save current operating state for STOP case (only states 1-4)
  - id: MLC_43
    en-US: |-
      1 = filling tank
      2 = heating tank
      3 = filling bottle
      4 = shifting bottle
  - id: MLC_44
    en-US: Reactivate old state after STOP
  - id: MLC_45
    en-US: |-
      1 = filling tank
      2 = heating tank
      3 = filling bottle
      4 = shifting bottle
  - id: MLC_46
    en-US: Program alarm - manual triggered
  - id: MLC_47
    en-US: Program alarm - out of error code
  - id: MLC_48
    en-US: Call filling function
